{"id":"42cf8de6b8a605d39926b24e9c51b1bd6e2f3f47","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1248418","title":"Codex 桌面客户端是不的自动审批是不是有 bug 啊","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"layxy","excerpt":"OpenAI - @layxy - 感觉这两天更新后，审批一共有三个选项，分别是请求审批/自动审批/完全访问权限，但是现在自动审批经常会消失，默认改为请求审批，下拉就剩俩了，重启客户端后可恢复，但是过一会儿还是出现这个问题","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    <div><div><p><a href=\"/member/layxy\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=73&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></a></p><div><p><span>0.66</span><img src=\"/static/img/diamond-blue.png?r=2\" height=\"16\" alt=\"D\"></p></div></div>\n    \n    \n    \n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a> · <span title=\"2026-10-13 15:37:17 +08:00\">21h 56m ago</span> · 818 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>感觉这两天更新后，审批一共有三个选项，分别是请求审批/自动审批/完全访问权限，但是现在自动审批经常会消失，默认改为请求审批，下拉就剩俩了，重启客户端后可恢复，但是过一会儿还是出现这个问题</p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/审批\"><li></li> 审批</a><a href=\"/tag/自动审批\"><li></li> 自动审批</a><a href=\"/tag/客户端\"><li></li> 客户端</a></P><p><span>6 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-14 10:22:24 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18175140\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/226bff2c35001dfe82f7f07318c4e856?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Fudd\" data-uid=\"509190\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Fudd\">Fudd</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 16:00:43 +08:00\">21h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我之前也遇到过，后面是开 tun 模式解决的。启动时开 tun 走代理后，用的过程中不会突然没有自动审批。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18175167\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e60e/6bbe/508218_normal.png?m=1790230041\" alt=\"94nb\" data-uid=\"508218\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/94nb\">94nb</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 16:05:31 +08:00\">21h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我的自动审批，他不会弹审批，而是直接默认给我拒绝了。。。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18177693\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b38c/efb6/36502_normal.png?m=1698393818\" alt=\"RexKang\" data-uid=\"36502\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/RexKang\">RexKang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-14 10:22:24 +08:00\">3h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>前几天自动审批都拒绝了，一脸懵逼的改为手动审批，后来嫌麻烦，干脆开了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"0.66 layxy · 21h 56m ago · 818 views 感觉这两天更新后，审批一共有三个选项，分别是请求审批/自动审批/完全访问权限，但是现在自动审批经常会消失，默认改为请求审批，下拉就剩俩了，重启客户端后可恢复，但是过一会儿还是出现这个问题 审批 自动审批 客户端6 replies • 2026-10-14 10:22:24 +08:00 1 Fudd 21h 32m ago 我之前也遇到过，后面是开 tun 模式解决的。启动时开 tun 走代理后，用的过程中不会突然没有自动审批。 2 94nb 21h 27m ago 我的自动审批，他不会弹审批，而是直接默认给我拒绝了。。。。 6 RexKang 3h 10m ago 前几天自动审批都拒绝了，一脸懵逼的改为手动审批，后来嫌麻烦，干脆开了。","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T05:33:18.12